  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 280,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 102,
   "text": "**1.** Ctrl+Z\n<small>← User · thao tác người dùng</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 422,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 212,
   "text": "**2.** IA_FurnitureUndo (Started), KHÔNG giữ Shift\n`UndoLastAction()`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#UndoLastAction (Ctrl+Z) — v1.20 +dispatch EntryKind (U2.3)|BP_UndoManager › UndoLastAction]]\n<small>← BP_FoffPlayerController · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 674,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "**3.** hủy phiên chỉnh đang dở\n`CancelInteractiveEdit()`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#CancelInteractiveEdit() — Custom Event (v1.21, U2.4) — 6A của session|BP_UndoManager › CancelInteractiveEdit]]\n<small>nội bộ · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1345,
   "y": 904,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 212,
   "text": "▸ nếu entry là ParamCommand\n**4.** tìm ghế theo ID\n`ResolveByPersistentId()`\n↗ [[BP_FurnitureSceneManager#ResolveByPersistentId(Id String) → (OutActor BP_FurnitureActor, bFound Bool)|BP_FurnitureSceneManager › ResolveByPersistentId]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1785,
   "y": 1156,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 300,
   "text": "▸ nếu entry là ParamCommand\n**5.** đảo đúng 1 thông số, KHÔNG respawn\n`ApplyParamCommand(Before) → SetSlotScalarParam()`\n↗ [[MaterialSlotService_Reference#SetSlotScalarParam / SetSlotVectorParam / SetSlotTextureParam(Mesh, Records&, SlotName, HintIndex, ParamName, Value) → bool|MaterialSlotService_Reference › SetSlotScalarParam]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 1496,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 234,
   "text": "▸ ngược lại: entry là Snapshot\n**6.** khôi phục ảnh full entry N−1, destroy + spawn lại\n`RestoreSnapshot() (chi tiết 5e)`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#RestoreSnapshot(IndexHistory, PreviousActor) — v1.10 hợp nhất spawn path qua SpawnFurnitureCopy|BP_UndoManager › RestoreSnapshot]]\n<small>nội bộ · ✓K2</small>",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2225,
   "y": 1770,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 234,
   "text": "**7.** báo tin\n`Broadcast OnHistoryChanged → RefreshParamPanel()`\n↗ [[WBP_FurnitureInventory#`RefreshParamPanel()` — Function — AS-BUILT ĐẦY ĐỦ 18/09/2026 (K2Node export thật)|WBP_FurnitureInventory › RefreshParamPanel]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "n14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 2044,
   "width": 780,
   "height": 70,
   "text": "📝 Redo = Ctrl+Shift+Z → IA_FurnitureRedo → RedoLastAction(): Command → After · Snapshot → ảnh của chính entry N",
   "color": "3"
  }
 ],
